        <notes><![CDATA[
        DOMPurify 3.3.2 bundled in swagger-ui-5.32.2.
        All RetireJS / GHSA advisory findings suppressed - Swagger UI is only accessible
        to authenticated internal users, reducing exploitability to near zero.
